  "details": "Hello, as of late I've noticed the slight annoyance that the \"Here Tab\" has for instance moderators with having 2 different moderation actions split between the normal \"World Actions\". My request is to simply bundle the \"Close Instance\" button with the \"Player Interaction buttons\", which would allow instance moderators to collapse this new tab and make simple mistakes such as accidentally pressing important moderation buttons from happening. :'D\n\nThe image attached to this request is a simple example I made really quickly that could show how it could be done!",
